description: 'Create a new module using three-start.'
---

1. Behaviors must be created in `src/webgl/modules`.
2. The filename must match exactly the name I give to you. If I don't provide a name, you must ask me for it.
3. Component starting structure must be the following:

```ts
import { ContextModule } from 'three-start'

// Add this dummy type ONLY if I tell you to add module events.
type ModuleEvents = {
	eventName: [eventData: any]
}

// Then include the module events in the type
export class ModuleName extends ContextModule<ModuleEvents> {
	onAwake() {}

	onDestroy() {}

	onUpdate() {}
}
```

4. `ModuleName` must be the name of the module I provided you.
